@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam ArrowFontSize 14
skinparam NoteFontSize 14
skinparam sequenceGroupFontSize 14
skinparam sequenceGroupHeaderFontSize 14
hide footbox
participant Sampler
participant Bmp280
participant RouterI2cBus as Bus
participant "STM32 / Wire" as MCU
participant MqttPublisher as Output
participant Broker
note over Sampler, Bmp280 : main() initializes before starting the worker
activate Sampler
Sampler -> Bmp280 : readForced()
activate Bmp280
Bmp280 -> Bus : write forced mode
Bus -> MCU : write RPC
MCU -> MCU : Wire write
MCU --> Bus : result
Bus --> Bmp280 : bool
Bmp280 -> Bmp280 : Clock.delayUs()
Bmp280 -> Bus : read status + data
Bus -> MCU : read RPC(s)
MCU -> MCU : Wire burst read
MCU --> Bus : bytes
Bus --> Bmp280 : bytes
Bmp280 -> Bmp280 : compensate()
Bmp280 --> Sampler : Error + Measurement
deactivate Bmp280
alt valid measurement
 Sampler -> Output : callback / JSON / publish
 Output -> Broker : queue QoS 0
 Output --> Sampler : queued / unavailable
else acquisition failed
 Sampler -> Sampler : callback reports error
end
Sampler -> Sampler : wait / stop
deactivate Sampler
note over Bus, MCU
 MessagePack via arduino-router.
 provide_safe serves Wire in loop context.
end note
@enduml
